; Smart Citizen user.ini lines for hauling contracts.
; Paste them in <Smart Citizen data>\LIVE\user.ini while Smart Citizen is closed,
; then open Smart Citizen and click Apply Enhancements.

; Mission page, sub-line: the pickup, highlighted.
hauling_collect_objective=Pick up at <EM4>~mission(location)</EM4>
; HUD tracker: short line. |Address writes the station in Game.log instead of "Stanton System".
HaulCargo_obj_itemspecifics_01=~mission(amount)/~mission(total) ~mission(item) > <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address)</EM4>
; Mission page, delivery line: stock text, destination highlighted.
hauling_deliver_resource_objective=Deliver ~mission(amount)/~mission(total) SCU of ~mission(item) to <EM4>~mission(Destination|Address|ListAll)</EM4>.

; Contract title: every pickup of Ling Family MultiToSingle hauls (4 pickups,
; Location to Location3). Shows in the mobiGlas list and lands in Game.log.
LingFamily_HaulCargo_MultiToSingle_title=Ling Family ~mission(ReputationRank) Cargo Haul - ~mission(CargoGradeToken) Scale - ~mission(Location|Address), ~mission(Location1|Address), ~mission(Location2|Address), ~mission(Location3|Address) > ~mission(Destination|Address) <EM4>[BP]</EM4> <EM4>[100 Rep]</EM4>

; Not tested in game yet: route in titles that have none.
; A tag for a place the contract does not have (Destination2 on a two-stop run)
; may show as an empty or broken name: remove it if so.
; Ling Family SingleToMulti: one pickup, the drop-offs.
LingFamily_HaulCargo_SingleToMulti_title=Ling Family ~mission(ReputationRank) Cargo Haul - ~mission(CargoGradeToken) Scale - ~mission(Location|Address) > ~mission(Destination|Address), ~mission(Destination1|Address), ~mission(Destination2|Address)
; Stock SingleToMulti titles list two drop-offs only, even on three-stop runs.
Covalex_HaulCargo_SingleToMulti_title=~mission(ReputationRank) Rank - ~mission(CargoGradeToken) Cargo Haul - ~mission(Location|Address) > ~mission(Destination|Address), ~mission(Destination1|Address), ~mission(Destination2|Address) <EM4>[BP?]</EM4> <EM4>[50–8,000 Rep]</EM4>
; Red Wind direct hauls (Pyro): A to B.
RedWind_HaulCargo_CFP_RegionLink_title_001=Red Wind Direct Cargo Haul - ~mission(Location|Address) > ~mission(Destination|Address)
RedWind_HaulCargo_HH_RegionLink_title_001=Red Wind Direct & Discreet Cargo Haul - ~mission(Location|Address) > ~mission(Destination|Address)

; Do not put ~mission(Location) on a delivery line: it is the mission's first
; pickup, not this cargo's (tested in game, 4.x).
